    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates, for the first time, the simultaneous detection of separate greenhouse gas, anthropogenic aerosol, and natural forcing signals in ocean temperature change by using a novel attribution method based on fingerprints that incorporate both temporal evolution and vertical depth structure.",
